Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总算搞定了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 驻村的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你的胳膊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:26.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回村子吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得赶紧治疗才行…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 烦死了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别那么大声\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:34.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会震到伤口的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 可是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这种时候谁都会慌的吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的没事吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我失血太多了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.59,0:00:57.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有很多想说的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:00:59.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但总之 先回去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:17.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 你的胳膊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:19.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:20.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快治疗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:43.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:59.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第9话 战斗结束后）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.59,0:03:01.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:15.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我的左手臂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:18.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被吃掉了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:23.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想吃点什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:27.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:30.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,白银等级的冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对我们冒险者公会来说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是极其宝贵的资源！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:37.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是要满足地区内\n大范围的任务需求的情况下\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:41.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他们所承担的责任自然更为重大\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正因如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为了让他们能够长久地工作下去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:48.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须严格筛选委托任务！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:50.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在情况允许的范围内\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:52.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,请优先让他尽快恢复战斗力吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:54.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,远程通话到此结束\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是 现在结束远程通话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:07.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 奥莉芙酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:10.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这饭原来是奥莉芙酱的吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 因为我肚子饿了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:14.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,忍不住就…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:19.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的非常抱歉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:22.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到那里\n居然有两只准灾害级的魔物…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:26.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这完全应该归咎于\n我们的情报收集不够充分\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:27.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对东云先生你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:30.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我实在不知道该如何道歉才好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抬起头来吧 奥莉芙酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:51.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正还有右手 没事的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是伤员哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这样你就能消气的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,请便吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不… 说什么“请便”\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:11.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你胸也没多大…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:18.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天还是请您在二楼好好休息吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来访的人络绎不绝啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说莉露在干什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天还没见到那家伙呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:49.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大叔 醒了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:51.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 胳膊真的没了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不痛吗？没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,伤口已经用治疗术治好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:04.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只是失血过多\n所以他们让我好好休息而已\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:12.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这还是你来这个村子后\n第一次受伤吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:15.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,听说你救了村里的年轻人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是矮人族的族长吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是同一个村子的人\n我当然会出手相助\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说得也是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以坐下吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:29.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:36.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 今天我来是为了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然就这么若无其事地开始了话题…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:41.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你聊一聊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:45.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你左臂的义肢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我主要做机关人偶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:54.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也做过几件义肢和义足\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你是否需要\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 这不是挺好的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,族长的技术很厉害的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:05.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗡 喀锵的那种！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:07.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且义肢的养护还能请他帮忙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让他做一个不就好了嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概要多少钱呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:15.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？村子和公会应该会出钱吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:16.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就拜托了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:19.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这活我接了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我就告辞了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:27.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能飞出去的拳头… 钻头…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真浪漫啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,钻头？那是什么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 大叔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:36.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事需要我帮忙的吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:37.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都可以！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:41.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,倒没什么事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙也不来探病\n到底在干些什么呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:50.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露在吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还真是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:58.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 逃走了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:07:59.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:01.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我为了保护她胳膊都没了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她这是什么意思？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:06.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的？那她肯定得跑啊 大叔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:09.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？我明明救了她一命\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 这多尴尬啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:13.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定觉得\n是她害得你再也没法冒险了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,之类的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:17.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:19.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是所谓的少女心吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒觉得是人之常情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:26.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再也没法去冒险了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:28.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真没办法啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 阿尼扬戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,诶？喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 放开我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:42.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样不行的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:45.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在想什么啊 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:47.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该好好静养才行啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:48.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 大叔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工会的姐姐都哭了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:52.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:55.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,请你好好休息一段时间吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是她的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:09:00.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还是回去吧 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:03.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是史莱姆出现了该怎么办啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:04.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那能怎么办\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:06.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你受了重伤啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会没命的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:09.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:13.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:18.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的工作是收集尤格尔树的果实\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:23.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是阿始 你已经没法爬这种树了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:26.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我看好了 笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:35.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我会从上面放绳子下来的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:37.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就顺着绳子爬上来吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:41.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 还挺滑的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙 别捣乱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:52.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:53.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大叔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然出了点小意外\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:03.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但这种活交给我就是小菜一碟！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都怪莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:11.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你连树都没法爬了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:15.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,确实…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:18.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有很多话想对你说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:22.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不擅长长篇大论…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,简而言之\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你平安无事真是太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:43.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:47.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露会变得更强的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:49.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要变得能够替代阿始的左手臂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:55.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 还要变得能够养活阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会变得更强给你看的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:01.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你没办法啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:04.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会变得更强 给大叔零花钱的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你们两个小鬼头…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:09.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,算了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:16.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不抱什么期望\n但我会等着你们的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:22.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎 虽然你们让我好好休息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:28.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我就是不习惯啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:31.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望义肢能快点做好啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工作也攒了一大堆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我得快点回归工作才行啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:37.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:40.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你就安心让人好好给你做个义肢吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:43.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡姐姐！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:48.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我听说青梅竹马受了重伤\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在你回归之前\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:54.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,公会的工作我们会帮你顶着的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你又有什么企图？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真没礼貌啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:00.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,椅子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:00.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:04.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,受重伤之后的冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在之后的冒险中也处处碰壁…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:08.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这种情况 你应该见过不少了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好好调整自己的状态吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 你们去做任务能行吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:17.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我们本来也没打算乱来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:21.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别看这家伙这副样子\n他在银级冒险者里头实力也是顶尖的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:25.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来他不只是个变态而已吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:27.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这么回事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不用操心 安心休养吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:37.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能够不着急慢慢来 这可是件好事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能做出质量更高的义肢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:43.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是对你还是对这个村子\n都是有益的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.93,0:12:44.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我试着搭了个模拟神经回路\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:49.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉如何？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.43,0:12:55.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能动能动 这义肢好厉害啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:59.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过果然还是没有触感啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算是矮人的技术\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也做不到将触感恢复如初\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:08.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但除此之外\n义肢可是能够凌驾原本的手臂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它能够经得起任何冒险\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:14.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不管是掉进火山\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还是被龙踩踏\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它都能够扛住\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可扛不住啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:24.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以说矮人真是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:27.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哟\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.55,0:13:30.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们干什么呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在做椅子呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:36.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上次族长不是坐坏了一个嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:37.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:41.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这把椅子\n就算真的龙坐上去也不会坏哦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:43.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还真像矮人的风格啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你真厉害 阿尼扬戈酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,连这种东西都会做\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿 别这么夸我啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:53.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,族长是我师父\n所以我多少还是有点本事的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:57.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你知道师父是什么意思吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:13:58.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:00.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,当然知道啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:01.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是很厉害的家伙对吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:02.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,疼疼疼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:07.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,戴爷爷\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,戴爷爷 你没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:11.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬戈酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拔萝卜又把腰闪了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:16.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:19.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是今天还得再干一会儿…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:20.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不要硬撑了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:24.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,交给我们吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要把这个拔出来就行了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:32.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 对！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:36.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙怎么回事啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好恶心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:45.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别想跑\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:53.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你挺能干的嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬酱好厉害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:14:59.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也教教莉露吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:03.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-她进步了啊\n-你也有这么有用的特技啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:05.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-是老爷子教的吗？\n-你说什么！我再拔一根给你看！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:09.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,教阿尼扬戈拔萝卜的师父就是我啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,师父吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:21.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 戴上皮手套的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就看不太出来是义肢了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:26.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你能满意真是太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:29.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 你的技术可真是厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:31.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,族长也有师父吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:39.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻的时候\n我也曾经在师父门下磨练过技术\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:42.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然是这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:45.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我用的是钝器\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:46.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙用的是剑\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:51.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不擅长精灵术 而莉露擅长…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也许她跟别人学习会更好啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:59.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来 这个按钮是什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:10.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 你的义肢做好了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 感觉不错\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:22.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙也回来了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:24.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好像大显身手了一番哦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:27.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,听说那个做椅子的人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:29.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剑术和精灵术都很厉害噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:45.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:52.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,脱了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:57.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？你刚才说什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:00.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正又不会少块肉 有什么关系！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:02.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真够男人的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我住手\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你发什么疯啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:08.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该先向我告白才对吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:11.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我只是想看看他的体格…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:15.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始他…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:19.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪阿始 阿始♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:23.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪莉露是女孩子哦♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:24.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪阿始 阿始♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:27.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪阿始喜欢女孩子♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪喜欢女孩子♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:29.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:33.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪莉露是女孩子♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:37.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪阿始的身边♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:40.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪有莉露在哦♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:43.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,♪呼呼呼 就是这样♪\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:45.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这梦什么鬼啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:52.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谁让你擅自进到我梦里来了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:56.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别把梦魔的能力\n用在这么无聊的事上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:58.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还不是因为阿始你…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:17:59.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 快做好准备\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天 我要好好确认\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:10.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的剑术和精灵术\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:11.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,配不配做莉露的师父\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（山狼）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的任务我也会跟着你们\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:17.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么啊？这个笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:19.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:20.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,加油！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:21.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让你们跟着倒也无所谓\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:26.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但你的胳膊已经没事了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:28.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是康复训练！康复训练！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:40.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好强烈的视线\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个笨蛋！居然无视本小姐…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-去看一个大男人…\n-非常感谢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:47.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛啊 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别一直盯着看 真没礼貌\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:57.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:59.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心阿始的手臂…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:02.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要我说几遍才能懂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:05.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事！真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:06.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我看好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:14.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还有\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:24.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:28.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我换上义肢之后\n反而变得更强了好吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:31.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别总是那么垂头丧气的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？阿始没有变弱吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:37.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啰嗦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你一个小不点\n别为大人的事情操心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:45.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了 好厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:47.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始果然好厉害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:49.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哼！终于明白了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:53.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天要大干一场啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:57.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 我抓到山狼了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:58.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是兔子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:19:59.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,放了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你捡回一条命啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:04.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:08.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还得去考察那男人呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好火热的眼神…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:13.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,切 真是火大\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:18.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是考察那男人的机会！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:21.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:25.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:27.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:30.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我这美丽的一击…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:32.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,切 碍事的女人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干什么啊 很危险的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:41.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:44.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,少废话 为了我的自尊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:45.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我死吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:46.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:49.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女人的脾气真是让人捉摸不透\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:50.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别躲啊混蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:54.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看的是那个男人的剑术啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:00.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:01.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有山狼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:11.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是弓吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,确实是弓啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:16.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 你用的不是剑和精灵术吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:17.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说的明明是那样的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:21.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我一边保护维罗妮卡大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:24.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一边用风属性的精灵术劈开敌人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:26.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以看起来像是那样吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:27.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:29.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然是这么一回事吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:34.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我一整天的努力到底是为了什么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.46,0:21:35.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看来以后继续教你各种东西的人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:48.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概还是得我了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:52.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也只想阿始一个人教我啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:54.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:57.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那让我再说一遍吧 请多关照了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:21:58.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我的搭档\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:02.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下一话 理发与选择）\n
